42
00:01:41.040 --> 00:01:43.280
I just think that's such an empowering way to look at it.

43
00:01:43.280 --> 00:01:46.360
When you treat anxiety as a mechanical engine, it stops being

44
00:01:46.360 --> 00:01:48.960
this nebulous, overwhelming curse, you know?

45
00:01:49.000 --> 00:01:49.640
Exactly.

46
00:01:49.640 --> 00:01:51.720
You can start looking at the exhaust of that engine.

47
00:01:51.720 --> 00:01:52.840
Like does it idle too high?

48
00:01:52.840 --> 00:01:53.760
Does it backfire?

49
00:01:53.760 --> 00:01:53.960
Yeah.

50
00:01:54.080 --> 00:01:57.520
And recognizing those shapes of exhaust is really how you demystify

