55
00:02:06.760 --> 00:02:07.600
Yes, exactly.

56
00:02:07.600 --> 00:02:10.440
This is generalized anxiety disorder or GED.

57
00:02:10.920 --> 00:02:14.400
The diagnostic code for this one is F41.1.

58
00:02:14.560 --> 00:02:17.680
And the defining keyword is right there in the name, right?

59
00:02:17.920 --> 00:02:18.680
Generalized.

60
00:02:18.960 --> 00:02:22.240
The engine of fear isn't pointing at a specific threat like, I

