00:02:56.440 --> 00:02:59.000
chronic mechanical issue in the brain software.

74
00:02:59.080 --> 00:02:59.880
Ah, I see.

75
00:03:00.120 --> 00:03:02.440
Yeah, by the time an engine has been running hot for half a

76
00:03:02.440 --> 00:03:05.720
year, the brain has essentially built a new neuroplastic

