00:03:08.600 --> 00:03:10.800
So it's no longer a reaction to an event.

79
00:03:10.800 --> 00:03:11.760
It's the new baseline.

80
00:03:11.960 --> 00:03:15.760
Exactly. And that constant baseline takes a massive

81
00:03:15.760 --> 00:03:17.040
physical toll on the body.

82
00:03:17.040 --> 00:03:20.640
Yeah. Kuechly's restlessness, fatigue, trouble concentrating,

83
00:03:20.640 --> 00:03:25.120
irritability, muscle tension and disturbed sleep, which honestly

84
00:03:25.120 --> 00:03:27.120
brings us right back to that browser tabs analogy.

85
00:03:27.120 --> 00:03:29.400
It really does. The battery drain is the fatigue.

86
00:03:29.400 --> 00:03:31.560
Right. And the static is the trouble concentrating.

87
00:03:31.600 --> 00:03:34.080
And the muscle tension happens because your body is

