00:03:34.080 --> 00:03:35.920
basically losing homeostasis.

89
00:03:35.920 --> 00:03:38.200
Homeostasis, like the body's baseline.

90
00:03:38.200 --> 00:03:40.600
Yeah. Homeostasis is your body's natural balance.

91
00:03:40.840 --> 00:03:43.360
When that fear engine is constantly idling, your

92
00:03:43.360 --> 00:03:46.200
sympathetic nervous system, the one responsible for fight or

93
00:03:46.200 --> 00:03:48.880
flight is continually trickling adrenaline and

94
00:03:48.880 --> 00:03:50.560
cortisol into your bloodstream.

95
00:03:50.560 --> 00:03:53.360
Wow. So your body literally cannot power down.

96
00:03:53.400 --> 00:03:56.880
It can't. So to fix this, Kuechly outlines a combination

97
00:03:56.880 --> 00:03:58.680
approach for the first line treatment.

98
00:03:58.960 --> 00:04:01.840
It's cognitive behavioral therapy paired with either

99
00:04:01.840 --> 00:04:04.160
