00:04:26.520 --> 00:04:29.640
back up, which I guess helps quiet that background

110
00:04:29.640 --> 00:04:30.240
static.

111
00:04:30.240 --> 00:04:31.360
That's a great way to put it.

112
00:04:31.360 --> 00:04:33.760
And that chemical stabilization is absolutely

113
00:04:33.760 --> 00:04:36.040
crucial for the second part of the treatment, which

